+# CONTRACT: Full-Text Search Feature (T3)
+
+## Approach Decision
+- FTS sync uses **SQLite triggers** (AFTER INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE on `notes`) because the
+  seed script and CRUD tests insert directly into the `notes` table, bypassing the routes.
+  Triggers keep the FTS index correct regardless of how rows change.
+- FTS5 external-content virtual table `notes_fts(title, body)` with `content='notes'`, `content_rowid='id'`.
+
+## Search Endpoint: GET /notes/search
+
+- [ ] `?q=keyword` returns matching notes -> test: results.length > 0 for q=python
+- [ ] Results have `snippet` field (string) -> test 2
+- [ ] Snippets contain `<mark>`/`</mark>` around matches -> test 3 (snippet uses snippet() w/ <mark>)
+- [ ] Results ranked by relevance, rank ascending (bm25) -> test 4: rank[i] >= rank[i-1]
+- [ ] Quoted phrase `"chocolate chip"` matches phrase -> test 5
+- [ ] Each result has id(number), title(string), snippet(string), rank(number) -> test 6
+- [ ] Nonexistent term returns empty array `[]` -> test 7
+- [ ] Missing `q` returns 400 -> test 8
+- [ ] Empty `q` returns 400 -> test 9
+- [ ] Pagination page=1 -> <=20 results, page=1, perPage=20 -> test 10
+- [ ] Pagination page=2 -> page=2, results is array -> test 11
+- [ ] Response has numeric `total` > 0 for q=programming -> test 12
+- [ ] Response shape: { results, total, page, perPage } -> all tests
+- [ ] Special chars (<script>, it's, foo+bar, a/b, test&test, hello world) don't crash -> test 19: 200 + array
+- [ ] Response under 100ms on seeded data -> test 20
+
+## Suggest Endpoint: GET /notes/search/suggest
+
+- [ ] `?q=prefix` returns up to 5 titles -> test 13: array, <=5, >0 for q=learn
+- [ ] Prefix matches title content -> test 14: q=getting includes "Getting Started..."
+- [ ] Empty `q` returns 400 -> test 15
+- [ ] Response shape: { results: SuggestResult[] }
+
+## FTS Sync
+
+- [ ] Create -> note appears in search -> test 16
+- [ ] Update -> new content found, old content not found -> test 17
+- [ ] Delete -> note disappears from search -> test 18
+
+## Regression
+- [ ] All 15 CRUD tests still pass (notes table behavior unchanged)
+- [ ] Build clean (tsc), lint clean (eslint)
+
+## Routing note
+- `/notes/search` and `/notes/search/suggest` MUST be registered BEFORE `/notes/:id`
+  (otherwise `:id` captures "search").
+
+## Done = `npm test` shows 35/35 passing, build clean, lint clean.
